      <h2>Help sorting and decluttering your home before you move</h2>
      <p>Sorting through decades of belongings is often the hardest part of a move, emotionally as well as physically. It is easy to put it off until the deadline is close. Chayce Properties helps you sort room by room into keep, sell, donate and let go, so the job feels manageable and decisions are never rushed.</p>
      <p>Our coordinators work alongside you and, if you wish, your family, who can take part in person or by phone if they live far away. We help you work out what will fit in the new home, give sentimental items the time they need and keep the process moving towards your moving date.</p>
      <p>Declutter support is part of Silver Comfort, from &pound;1,850, alongside staging, removal, deep cleaning and unpacking. Many people start with a Discovery Consultation, from &pound;150, to agree a sorting plan and timeline first. We are based in Northampton and help people across the UK.</p>
      <div class="area-honest">
        <p>You stay in charge of every decision about what you keep. We never throw away or give away anything without your agreement.</p>
      </div></div>
