<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>How do I start decluttering before a move?</summary><p>Start with the least emotional rooms, such as the spare room or garage, and sort into keep, sell, donate and let go. A Discovery Consultation with Chayce gives you a personalised sorting plan and timeline.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you help sort a house for older people?</summary><p>Yes. Our coordinators help you sort room by room at your own pace, and family can join in person or remotely.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What happens to items I don't want?</summary><p>That is your decision. We help you decide what to keep, sell, pass to family or donate, and nothing is disposed of without your agreement.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does sorting a house take?</summary><p>Most people need three to six months to sort a family home comfortably. Shorter timescales are possible with a fuller-service package.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does declutter help cost?</summary><p>Declutter support is included in Silver Comfort from &pound;1,850. A Discovery Consultation at &pound;150 gives you a plan and budget before you commit.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

